WEBVTT

00:14:58.441 --> 00:15:01.673
Because you can see that I am putting
everything I have into this,

00:15:01.697 --> 00:15:03.312
I don't have any more than this.

00:15:03.336 --> 00:15:07.121
If you want it to be better, you've got
to show up and do your part of the deal.

00:15:07.145 --> 00:15:09.962
But if you don't do that,
you know what, the hell with it.

00:15:09.986 --> 00:15:12.668
I'm going to keep writing anyway
because that's my job.

00:15:12.692 --> 00:15:15.128
And I would please
like the record to reflect today

00:15:15.152 --> 00:15:17.150
that I showed up for my part of the job."

00:15:17.174 --> 00:15:20.165
(Laughter)

00:15:20.189 --> 00:15:22.252
Because --

00:15:22.276 --> 00:15:24.326
(Applause)

00:15:24.350 --> 00:15:26.498
Because in the end it's like this, OK --

00:15:26.522 --> 00:15:28.899
centuries ago in the deserts
of North Africa,

00:15:28.923 --> 00:15:33.566
people used to gather for these moonlight
dances of sacred dance and music